  "description": "Deoksun, who makes rice cakes in a courtesan house, one day meets her destined partner, Taemi. But that’s not all… her ideal type, the person she’s always dreamed of, also wants to “make rice cakes” with her…\n\n“Wait, the rice cakes you wanted to make with me weren’t the ones you actually prepare… you meant me?!”\n\nWill they be able to clear up this misunderstanding and make the rice cakes they both desire so much?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/what_kind_of_dduk), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/what_kind_of_dduk)",
